# openOODA/INDEX — The Polyrepo

File: openOODA/docs/INDEX.oot

This file is the overview of the openOODA project as a whole. It is the
front-door copy for human visitors. The agent-facing front door is
`ANCHOR.oo` at this repo root.

## 1. What it is

The openOODA polyrepo. Twelve independent repositories that
together form a capability-secure systems language. Every
effect requires an explicit capability token. Each repo owns
its own surface and release. The compiler is the substrate.
The other repos are siblings.

## 2. Surface

Twelve repos. Git tags as of 2026-09-04.
Each website page cites `openOODA/{repo}/docs/`.

| Repo | Role | Tag |
|------|------|-----|
| openOODA | Laws, RFCs, practices | v1.0.20 |
| oodar | Gen 1 C host | v4.0.0 |
| oodac | Compiler | v0.2.2 |
| std | Standard library | v1.0.8 |
| ooda | `ooda` driver | v0.2.7 |
| packaging | apt, dnf, pacman | v0.1.6 |
| opm | Package manager | v0.8.8 |
| catalog | Public package list | v0.0.1 |
| lsp | Language server | v0.6.12 |
| mcp | MCP server | v0.6.10 |
